# OneTerm VT parity expectation: the grid, cell-exact, nothing trimmed.
# Blessed by the vendored alacritty_terminal engine at US-0072 and FROZEN.
# Rows are newest first. Each run is `<count>*<content>;<attrs>;<fg>;<bg>;<underline>;<hyperlink>`.
# Do not hand-edit: regenerate with `vt-corpus bless --engine old --deviation <id>`.
version 1
columns 20
lines 8
display_offset 0
rows 108
row 0 wrap=0 20*0020;-;nForeground;nBackground;-;-
